msgstr "繼續考試或補交審查條件，讓錄取狀態向前推進。"

#. copy/nextOrientation
#: src/js/mytu.js:23
msgctxt "tree:copy#/nextOrientation"
msgid ""
"The formal admission edition now stands. Confirm the route and way back at "
"the arrival office, then ring for the first real thing you will do on "
"campus."
msgstr "正式錄取版本已經成立。去到着室認路、確認退路，再為入學後第一件真事敲鐘。"

