#. copy/outcomeBody/admitted
#: src/js/mytu.js:23
msgctxt "tree:copy#/outcomeBody/admitted"
msgid ""
"The panel approves direct progression to new-student registration; each "
"laboratory's field conditions still apply."
msgstr "評議同意直接進入新生報到；仍須遵守各研究室列出的現場條件。"

#. copy/outcomeBody/conditional
#: src/js/mytu.js:23
msgctxt "tree:copy#/outcomeBody/conditional"
msgid ""
"A place is reserved. Complete the specified method revision and safety "
"conditions to convert it to full admission."
msgstr "保留入學名額；完成指定方法補件與安全條件後轉為正式錄取。"

#. copy/outcomeBody/supplement
#: src/js/mytu.js:23
msgctxt "tree:copy#/outcomeBody/supplement"
msgid ""
"The question is worth keeping, but the method cannot yet identify the claim. "
"The same panel will review a supplement."
msgstr "問題值得保留，但方法尚不足以識別主張。補件後由原委員會重審。"

#. copy/outcomeBody/interview
#: src/js/mytu.js:23
msgctxt "tree:copy#/outcomeBody/interview"
msgid ""
"The written dossier cannot resolve the central disagreement. Explain "
"trade-offs and stop conditions in a spell-card interview."
msgstr "書面材料無法消除主要分歧；請在符卡式面試中說明取捨與停止條件。"

